Cloudflare OS — Vercel Edition
==============================

This project is a rewrite/derivative work of Cloudflare OS,
Copyright 2024 Cloudflare, Inc.
https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-os

Changes made:
-------------
This repository re-implements Cloudflare OS for a standard Vercel/Next.js
runtime (Next.js 14 + Postgres + Prisma). It replaces the original
Cloudflare Durable Objects, Dynamic Workers, Workers RPC, and KV/R2
persistence with equivalent functionality running on classic serverless
infrastructure. It is not the original Cloudflare OS code, and is provided
"as is" under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

